{"id":"vod_sn_37102","vodId":"37102","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"神是中学生","name_cn":"神是中学生","date":"2005-01-01","year":"2005","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/99b3945acbe3cead0f93dcaf050cf217.jpg"},"summary":"某一日机缘巧合之下，普通的中学生一桥友里惠（峰香织 配音）居然成为了法力高强的神！友里惠在第一时间将这一好消息告诉了好友四条光惠（峰香织 配音）和三枝祀（森永理科 配音），没想到自己的兴高采烈换来的却是朋友的冷漠相对，气愤的友里惠和朋友们打赌，要用神迹来证实她的身份。台风的来袭证明了友里惠的话，也给城市带来了不小的麻烦，这让友里惠明白了，越是高强的能力，就越要小心的使用。　　神也要恋爱呀，在友里惠的眼里，二宫健儿（宫崎一成 配音）就是那个集万千有点为一身的他。对待感情有些笨拙的友里惠能否如有神助的对二宫健儿坦白自己的心情呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:48:49","playable":true,"episodeCount":16,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1SqDLiNYTH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Zhh0jKYbvy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qar3tgxvXf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/w1wUQtV4dk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/urtqVhNLp51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/shjb7zj2Ek1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TBXEnNnq3E1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HZhpH8yHUe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7FqSjgNJGv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AUqPwi2u611/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XP9NxaRCYK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CB1FhtwCpK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xDyqKD4URW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/a5yRpJRUcY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rs